{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and nurture your own beautiful wildlife habitats in this cosy, wholesome nature game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in a sandbox nature simulator with a fully simulated ecosystem \u2014 everything is interconnected and constantly evolving, even when you're not playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract, observe, and identify over 300 real-world species \u2014 from flowers and fungi to birds, bees, and beetles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths fluttering in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders weaving webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/f20fa6a68b72a27d519088cc6f427289.avif?t=1762520395\" width=800 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/6b589a984dc38119e9963f82a7b2537f.avif?t=1762520395\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats \u2014 plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/fc6ce95b382c46b5bce401ac477b9339.avif?t=1762520395\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you\u2019re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/b623594ad3a8c9d2878af3c0c65bd479.avif?t=1762520395\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you\u2019re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 European plants and animals \u2014 each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sid</strong> - Sid is a fellow nature fan who\u2019s always nearby to help \u2014 or accidentally scare off a butterfly you\u2019re about to identify!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/0649aec811d556dd52efc9034d4be947.avif?t=1762520395\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230260?t=1762520395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/e9fe1f8854e71e7fea34607a44f624e61f3d6d60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762520395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/4bec157866e13c0e9e395021e366c84959e251a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762520395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/4bec157866e13c0e9e395021e366c84959e251a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762520395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and nurture your own beautiful wildlife habitats in this cosy, wholesome nature game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in a sandbox nature simulator with a fully simulated ecosystem \u2014 everything is interconnected and constantly evolving, even when you're not playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract, observe, and identify over 300 real-world species \u2014 from flowers and fungi to birds, bees, and beetles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths fluttering in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders weaving webs in tall grass.</p><p class=